|{{l|de|[[er]] [[kehrt]] '''heim'''||he returns home}} (''see'' [[heimkehren]])
|{{l|de|[[sie]] [[reist]] '''heim'''||she travels home}} (''see'' [[heimreisen]])
|{{l|de|[[wir]] [[zahlen]] '''heim'''||we retaliate}} (''see'' [[heimzahlen]])
